    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nSherry Fitzgerald Conor McManus are pleased to offer to the market a site with Full Planning Permission, at Moyetra TD, Clontibret, Co. Monaghan.\n\nThis impressive site extends to 1.4 Acres (approximately) with Full Planning Permission and plans for a detached dwelling and garage - designed by the renowned, Mc Guigan Architects. (Valid until July 2029).\n\nThe site benefits from a level profile and direct access off the public road. Offering a beautiful residential setting with panoramic views of the surrounding countryside. The site provides easy access to local amenities while retaining that secluded charm.\n\nThis area is very appealing being within easy reach of the village of Clontibret as well as the Monaghan-Castleblayney bypass.\n\nFurther details and maps available upon request."
      },
      {
